---
layout: layouts/base.njk
seo_title: "Books — Mikael Viima"
meta_description: "Books by Mikael Viima: the poetry collection FEED, in development in English; the Aarni Susi crime novels Verijälki and Rekyyli; and the nonfiction work Vaaralliset gurut, published as Manne Laukkanen."
og_type: "website"
---
{% import "partials/cover-macro.njk" as c %}
<section class="section theme-dark motif-host">
  {% include "partials/wind-mark.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="label content-section__label">Books</p>
    <h1 class="content-section__heading" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); max-width: none;">Poetry, crime, manipulation.</h1>
    <div class="content-section__body">
      <p>
        Mikael Viima's current English-language work is poetry:
        <strong>{{ current_work.poetry_title }}</strong>, a collection in development.
      </p>
      <p>
        His published fiction is the Aarni Susi series: psychologically unstable,
        hard-boiled crime novels set in contemporary Helsinki.
      </p>
      <p>
        His nonfiction, published under <strong>Manne Laukkanen</strong>, examines
        manipulation, coercive control, dangerous leaders and statistical
        psychological profiling.
      </p>
      <p>
        The existing books are published in Finnish by WSOY and Otava, Finland's
        two main publishing houses.
      </p>
      {%- for page in author.publisher_pages %}
      <p><a class="text-link" href="{{ page.url }}">View the {{ page.publisher }} author page</a></p>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight theme-dark rift" style="--rift-image: url('/assets/images/theme/alternative-ending-band.jpg'); --rift-position: 50% 100%">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="label content-section__label">{{ current_work.poetry_title }}</p>
    <h2 class="content-section__heading">In development.</h2>
    <p class="content-section__body">An English-language poetry collection of approximately {{ current_work.poem_count_approx }} poems, selected from a much larger body of work.</p>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="/poetry/">About {{ current_work.poetry_title }}</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{# Page order: poetry, then the Aarni Susi novels chronologically (ending with
    the unpublished third), then nonfiction. books.yaml lists the novels first,
    so the third-novel band is slotted in just before the first nonfiction entry. #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    {%- for book in books %}
    {%- if book.nonfiction and not loop.first and not books[loop.index0 - 1].nonfiction %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight theme-steel">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="label content-section__label">{{ current_work.aarni_susi_iii_title }}</p>
    <h2 class="content-section__heading">{{ current_work.aarni_susi_iii_status }}</h2>
    <p class="content-section__body">The third Aarni Susi novel continues the psychological and moral arc of the series.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    {%- endif %}
    <article class="book-detail" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-5); padding-bottom: var(--space-5); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(24,26,29,0.12);">
      <div>
        {{ c.cover(book) }}
      </div>
      <div class="book-detail__body">
        <h2 class="content-section__heading">{{ book.title }}</h2>
        <p class="book-card__meta">
          {%- if book.series %}Aarni Susi #{{ book.series_number }} — {% endif -%}
          {{ book.publisher }}, {{ book.year }} — {{ book.language }}
          {%- if book.nonfiction %} — Nonfiction{% endif %}
        </p>
        <div class="content-section__body">{{ book.card_summary | md | safe }}</div>
        {%- if book.literal_title_gloss %}
        <p class="book-note">Literal English gloss of the {{ book.language }} title: "{{ book.literal_title_gloss }}." {% if book.nonfiction %}Published under the author's real name, Manne Laukkanen.{% else %}This is not an announced English-edition title.{% endif %}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        <p><a class="button button--ghost" href="/books/{{ book.slug }}/">About {{ book.title }}</a></p>
      </div>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
